#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Search engine optimization (SEO) for documentation projects "
"</guides/technical-docs-seo-guide>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`文档项目的搜索引擎优化（SEO） </guides/technical-docs-seo-guide>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"This article explains how documentation can be optimized to appear in search"
" results, ultimately increasing traffic to your docs."
msgstr "本文讲解如何优化文档以出现在搜索结果中，最终为你的文档带来更多流量。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:8
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Using traffic analytics </traffic-analytics>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`使用流量分析 </traffic-analytics>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"In this guide, you can learn to use Read the Docs' built-in traffic "
"analytics for your documentation project."
msgstr "本指南讲解如何为你的文档项目使用 Read the Docs 内置的流量分析。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Managing translations for Sphinx projects </guides/manage-"
"translations-sphinx>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`管理 Sphinx 项目的翻译 </guides/manage-translations-sphinx>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"This guide walks through the process needed to manage translations of your "
"documentation. Once this work is done, you can setup your project under Read"
" the Docs to build each language of your documentation by reading "
":doc:`/localization`."
msgstr ""
"本指南讲解管理文档翻译所需的流程。完成这些工作后，可按 :doc:`/localization` 的说明在 Read the Docs "
"上设置项目，构建文档的每种语言。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:15
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Supporting Unicode in Sphinx PDFs </guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`在 Sphinx PDF 中支持 Unicode </guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"Sphinx offers different LaTeX engines that have better support for Unicode "
"characters, relevant for instance for Japanese or Chinese."
msgstr "Sphinx 提供不同的 LaTeX 引擎，对 Unicode 字符支持更好，例如对日语或中文。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Cross-referencing with Sphinx </guides/cross-referencing-with-"
"sphinx>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`使用 Sphinx 进行交叉引用 </guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"When writing documentation you often need to link to other pages of your "
"documentation, other sections of the current page, or sections from other "
"pages."
msgstr "编写文档时，你经常需要链接到文档的其他页面、当前页面的其他章节，或其他页面的章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:22
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Linking to other projects with Intersphinx </guides/intersphinx>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`使用 Intersphinx 链接到其他项目 </guides/intersphinx>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"This section shows you how to maintain references to named sections of other"
" external Sphinx projects."
msgstr "本节讲解如何维护对其他外部 Sphinx 项目中具名章节的引用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:25
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Using Jupyter notebooks in Sphinx </guides/jupyter>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`在 Sphinx 中使用 Jupyter Notebook </guides/jupyter>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:26
msgid ""
"There are a few extensions that allow integrating Jupyter and Sphinx, and "
"this document will explain how to achieve some of the most commonly "
"requested features."
msgstr "有若干扩展支持集成 Jupyter 与 Sphinx，本文档将讲解如何实现其中最常被要求的功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:29
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Migrating from rST to MyST </guides/migrate-rest-myst>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`从 rST 迁移到 MyST </guides/migrate-rest-myst>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"In this guide, you will find how you can start writing Markdown in your "
"existing reStructuredText project, or migrate it completely."
msgstr "本指南讲解如何在现有的 reStructuredText 项目中开始编写 Markdown，或完全迁移过去。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:34
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Enabling offline formats </guides/enable-offline-formats>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`启用离线格式 </guides/enable-offline-formats>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:35
msgid ""
"This guide provides step-by-step instructions to enabling offline formats of"
" your documentation."
msgstr "本指南提供启用文档离线格式的分步说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:37
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`Using search analytics </search-analytics>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`使用搜索分析 </search-analytics>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"In this guide, you can learn to use Read the Docs' built-in search analytics"
" for your documentation project."
msgstr "本指南讲解如何为你的文档项目使用 Read the Docs 内置的搜索分析。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Adding custom CSS or JavaScript to Sphinx documentation </guides"
"/adding-custom-css>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`为 Sphinx 文档添加自定义 CSS 或 JavaScript </guides/adding-custom-css>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Adding additional CSS or JavaScript files to your Sphinx documentation can "
"let you customize the look and feel of your docs or add additional "
"functionality."
msgstr "向 Sphinx 文档添加额外的 CSS 或 JavaScript 文件，可以定制文档的观感或增加额外功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Embedding content from your documentation </guides/embedding-"
"content>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`嵌入文档内容 </guides/embedding-content>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:46
msgid ""
"Did you know that Read the Docs has a public API that you can use to embed "
"documentation content? There are a number of use cases for embedding "
"content, so we've built our integration in a way that enables users to build"
" on top of it."
msgstr "你知道 Read the Docs 提供了可用于嵌入文档内容的公共 API 吗？嵌入内容有多种使用场景，因此我们以便于用户在其基础上构建的方式设计了集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:50
msgid ""
"⏩️ :doc:`Adding \"Edit Source\" links on your Sphinx theme </guides/edit-"
"source-links-sphinx>`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`在 Sphinx 主题中添加\"编辑源文件\"链接 </guides/edit-source-links-sphinx>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/content/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"Using your own theme? Add some extra variables in the Sphinx "
"``html_context``, to add an \"edit source\" link at the top of all pages."
msgstr "使用自己的主题？在 Sphinx 的 ``html_context`` 中添加一些额外变量，即可在所有页面顶部加上\"编辑源文件\"链接。"

